        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Yosefe wakaya, wakambila Palo ne, Tatu wanyi ne bana betu bakulua ku buloba bua Kanâna ne mikoko yabo ne bimuna biabo ne bintu bionso bidibo nʼabi, mona, badi mu buloba bua Goshene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakasungula bantu batanu ba munkatshi mua bana babo, wakabafila kudi Palô. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Palo wakabakonka ne, Nudi benji ba mudimu kai? Bakakudimuna Palo ne, Bantu bebe badi balami ba mikoko, ne tuetu ne batatuʼetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakambila Palo ne, Tuakuluila bua kushikama mu buloba ebu, katuena ne muaba wa kudisha bimuna bietu bualu bua tshiole tshidi tshikole mu buloba bua Kanana, nunku tudi tukusengelela ne, Witabushe bua bantu bebe bashikama mu buloba bua Goshene ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Palô wakambila Yosefe ne, Tatuʼebe ne bana benu bakulua kudi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "buloba bua Ejipitu buonso budi ku mpala kuebe, ushikike tatuʼebe ne bana benu mu buloba budi butamba buimpe bashikame mu buloba bua Goshene, ne biwamanya bantu ba lungenyi luimpe munkatshi muabo, ubateke balami ba bimuna bianyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefe wakalua ne Yakoba, tatuʼandi, wakamuteka ku mpala kua Palô, ne Yakoba wakavudishila Palo disanka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Palo wakakonka Yakoba ne, Bidimu bia muoyo webe bidi bungi munyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakoba wakamukudimuna ne Bidimu bia luendu lua bukole buanyi bidi lukama ne makumi asatu, matuku anyi adi makese, akadi mule tente ne malu mabi, kaena manze kufika ku bungi bua bidimu bia bankambua banyi mu luendu lua bukole buabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakoba wakavudishila Palo disanka, wakumuka ku mesu kua Palo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefe wakalesha tatuʼandi ne bana babo muaba bua kushikamabo mu buloba bua Ejipitu, mu buloba buakatamba buimpe, mu buloba bua Lamesese, bu muakamba Palô. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefe wakadisha tatuʼandi ne bana babo ne bantu bonso bakadi mu nsubu wa tatuʼandi, ku meku abo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bintu bia kudia kabiakadi mu buloba, bualu bua tshiole tshiakatamba bukole, nunku bantu bonso ba mu Ejipitu ne ba mu buloba bua Kanana bakamba kufua ne nzala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefe wakasangisha argent yonso yakadi mu buloba bua Ejipitu ne ya mu buloba bua Kanâna ku bintu bia kudia biakasumbabo, Yosefe wakalua ne argent yonso mu nsubu wa Palo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakashika argent yonso ya mu buloba bua Ejipitu ne ya mu buloba bua Kanana, hashishe Bena Ejipitu bonso bakalua kudi Yosefe, bakamuambila ne, Utuhe bia kudia, netufuile ku mesu kuebe bualu kai? Argent yetu yakushika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefe wakamba ne, Numpe bimuna bienu, nennuhe bia kudia ku bimuna bienu bikale argent yenu mishike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakalua ne bimuna biabo kudi Yosefe, ne Yosefe wakashintakasha nʼabo bia kudia ku tubalu tuabo ne ngombe yabo ne mikoko yabo ne nyama ya mpunda, yeye wakabadisha tshidimu tshijima ne bintu bia kudia biakashintakasheye ku bimuna biabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakashika tshidimu atshi, bakalua kudiye tshidimu tshibidi, bakamuambila ne, Katuena tusokoka mukelenge wetu bualu tuakashiki sha argent yetu yonso, ne bimuna bietu mbia mukelenge wetu kabidi kakuena tshintu tshidi tshishala ku mesu kua mukelenge wanyi, anu mibidi yetu ne maloba etu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi netufuile ku mesu kuebe, netujimishe buloba buetu kabidi bualu kai? Utusumbe bietu ne buloba buetu kabidi ku bia kudia ne tuetu ne buloba buetu netuikale bahika ba Palo, utuhe bia kudia, tuikale ne muoyo, katufu, ne buloba kabushadi hatuhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Yosefe wakasumbila Palo buloba bua Ejipitu buonso bualu bua Muena Ejipitu yonso wakahana madimi andi bualu bua tshiole tshiakabatamba bukole, buloba buakalua bua Palô. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua bantu aba, yeye wakabateka ku musoko ne ku musoko ku matshika a buloba bua Ejipitu to ne kunfudilu kuabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye kakasumba buloba bua babuki, bualu bua babuki bakadi ne tshituha tshiabo kudi Palo, ne bakadila bintu biakabaha Palo nunku bobo kabakahana buloba buabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Yosefe wakambila bantu ne, Monai, nakunusumbila Palo lelu, nuenu ne buloba buenu ka maminu adi aha bua bualu buenu, nuakune mu buloba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku hanuahuola bintu, nenufile tshi tuha tshitanu kudi Palô ne nuenu nenushale ne bituha binai bua kukunaku kabidi ne bua kudidisha ne bonso banudi nʼabo mu nsubu yenu, ne bana benu bakese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bobo bakamuambila ne, Wewe wakusungi la mioyo yetu, utuendeshe diakalengele ku mesu kua mukelenge wetu, nebikale bahika ba Palo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefe wakafunda mukanda bua lu bua buloba bua Ejipitu, udiku to ne katataka, ne, Tshituha tshitanu tshia bintu bionso ntshia Palo, anu buloba bua babuki nkayabo kabuakalua bua Palô.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isalele wakashikama mu buloba bua Ejipitu, mu buloba bua Goshene bakangata bintu mu buloba abu, bakavulangana bakakumbana ba bungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakoba wakashala mu buloba bua Ejipitu bidimu dikumi ne muanda mutekete, nunku bidimu bionso bia muoyo wa Yakoba biakadi lukama ne makumi anai ne muanda mutekete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dituku dia lufu lua Isalele diakalua ha buihi, Wakabikila muanʼandi Yosefe, wakamuambila ne, Bingikala ne luse ku mesu kuebe, ulenge tshianza tshiebe muinshi mua tshibelu tshinyi, uditshihe bua kungenzela malu mimpe ne a bushuwa, ndi nkutendekena ne, Kabanjiki mu Ejipitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
